  "limitations": [
    "FASTA is not a supported FastQC input format.",
    "Goby is listed in GUI filters but has no verified parser implementation.",
    "Compact Reads is listed in GUI filters but has no verified parser implementation.",
    ".bz compression is not actually decompressed by the FastQC parser; .bz2 is supported.",
    "UBAM is mapped to the broader BAM EDAM concept.",
    "FAST5 is mapped to the broader HDF5 EDAM concept.",
    "csFASTQ is mapped to FASTQ as a related EDAM concept.",
    "stdin is an input mechanism rather than a file format.",
    "fastqc.fo is mapped to the broader XML EDAM concept."
